Greetings Mr. Epstein,

Attached for your review and comments are photos of the following:

More detailed photos of the fishtail palms and bouganvilleas planted earlier this week from the kitchen -
laundry area to the intersection;

The boulders destined for the grotto; staging area at the top of the hill where the boulders will be moved this
weekend. On Monday the boulders are scheduled to be moved to the grotto site to begin the first level stacking
of the boulder wall; the grotto site to date;

The plantings in front of the electrical near the outdoor tub area;

Trench from soil removed from the area in front of the electrical, to address drainage issues;

Progress of the master suite foyer painting:

The kitchen appliances in place; some of the electrical work; closer photo of the fans.

There are more photos, which I am sending in a second email shortly.

Respectfully submitted,

Daphne




