New palms planted in Basket - the 3 dead palms were removed and replaced

Road to Flagpole Pool - the hillside clean up continues - trimming the grass and weeds, removing acacia,
burying irrigation piping and exposed electrical as they go along

Road to Five Palms - the 2 dead palms were removed and new ones put in place

Cabana I and Cabana 2 Showers - the Grohe shower rough-in components are installed - the fixtures and trims
will be installed tomorrow

Gym A/C - the new unit was installed today - Dave will close out the project tomorrow and confirm that
everything is working order

